        <div class="hero__metric">
          <span class="hero__metric-value">~40%</span>
          <span class="hero__metric-label">Smaller ciphertext vs. prior ABE schemes</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hero__metric-divider"></div>
        <div class="hero__metric">
          <span class="hero__metric-value">O(1)</span>
          <span class="hero__metric-label">Pairing operations for policy evaluation</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hero__metric-divider"></div>
        <div class="hero__metric">
          <span class="hero__metric-value">IND-CPA</span>
          <span class="hero__metric-label">Security under standard assumptions</span>
        </div>
      </div-->
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- OVERVIEW -->
  <section class="overview" id="overview">
    <div class="container overview__inner">
      <div class="overview__label">
        <span class="section-label">001 · Overview</span>
      </div>
      <div class="overview__body">
        <h2 class="overview__heading">
          Encryption that understands<br /><em style="font-style:normal;">context.</em>
        </h2>
        <div class="overview__columns">
          <div class="overview__col">
            <p>
             Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Nunc tempus malesuada eros et consectetur. Sed sed rutrum enim. Curabitur ut enim velit. Donec vel sapien quis justo dignissim dapibus quis id erat.
            </p>
            <p>
             Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Nunc tempus malesuada eros et consectetur. Sed sed rutrum enim. Curabitur ut enim velit. Donec vel sapien quis justo dignissim dapibus quis id erat.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="overview__col">
            <p>
             Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Nunc tempus malesuada eros et consectetur. Sed sed rutrum enim. Curabitur ut enim velit. Donec vel sapien quis justo dignissim dapibus quis id erat.
            </p>
            <p>
             Nam vel diam faucibus, condimentum augue et, sodales dolor. Class aptent taciti sociosqu ad litora torquent per conubia nostra, per inceptos himenaeos.  
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="overview__comparison">
        <div class="comparison-card comparison-card--before">
          <div class="comparison-card__header">
            <span class="comparison-card__tag tag--muted">TDF</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="comparison-list">
            <li class="comparison-list__item comparison-list__item--no">Binary access: key or no key</li>
            <li class="comparison-list__item comparison-list__item--no">Key distribution at scale is complex</li>
            <li class="comparison-list__item comparison-list__item--no">Policy lives outside ciphertext</li>
            <li class="comparison-list__item comparison-list__item--no">Requires re-encryption on policy change</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="comparison-divider">
          <div class="comparison-divider__arrow">→</div>
        </div>
        <div class="comparison-card comparison-card--after">
          <div class="comparison-card__header">
            <span class="comparison-card__tag tag--amber">CABE</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="comparison-list">
            <li class="comparison-list__item comparison-list__item--yes">Policy-based access over attributes</li>
            <li class="comparison-list__item comparison-list__item--yes">Attribute authorities issue keys</li>
            <li class="comparison-list__item comparison-list__item--yes">Policy embedded in ciphertext</li>
            <li class="comparison-list__item comparison-list__item--yes">Dynamic attribute revocation support</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FEATURES -->
  <section class="features" id="features">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-label">002 · Security Properties</span>
        <h2 class="section-heading">Built on rigorous<br />cryptographic foundations.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="features__grid">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-card__icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <rect x="8" y="14" width="24" height="20" rx="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              <path d="M14 14V10a6 6 0 0 1 12 0v4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              <circle cx="20" cy="24" r="3" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.7"/>
              <path d="M20 27v3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="feature-card__title">IND-CPA Security</h3>
          <p class="feature-card__body">
            Ciphertexts are semantically secure under adaptive chosen-plaintext
            attacks, provably reducible to the Decisional Bilinear Diffie-Hellman
            assumption.
          </p>
          <div class="feature-card__tag">Formal proof required</div>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-card__icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <circle cx="20" cy="20" r="12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              <path d="M20 8v4M20 28v4M8 20h4M28 20h4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              <circle cx="20" cy="20" r="4" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.5"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="feature-card__title">Collusion Resistance</h3>
          <p class="feature-card__body">
            Multiple users cannot pool their attribute keys to exceed the access
            rights of any single user. Key blinding ensures cryptographic isolation
            between credential holders.
          </p>
          <div class="feature-card__tag">Per-user key randomisation</div>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-card__icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M10 30 L20 10 L30 30" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              <path d="M14 24h12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              <circle cx="20" cy="10" r="2.5" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.7"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="feature-card__title">Attribute Privacy</h3>
          <p class="feature-card__body">
            In KP-CABE mode, the ciphertext reveals no information about the
            attributes used during encryption. The encryptor's attribute set
            remains hidden from unauthorised decryptors.
          </p>
          <div class="feature-card__tag">Optional attribute hiding</div>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-card__icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M12 20h16M20 12l8 8-8 8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              <rect x="4" y="12" width="8" height="16" rx="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.5"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="feature-card__title">Forward Secrecy</h3>
          <p class="feature-card__body">
            Epoch-based key evolution ensures that compromise of current
            attribute keys does not decrypt historical ciphertexts. Key
            update operations are non-interactive.
          </p>
          <div class="feature-card__tag">Epoch-based key rotation</div>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-card__icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <rect x="6" y="6" width="12" height="12" rx="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              <rect x="22" y="6" width="12" height="12" rx="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.5"/>
              <rect x="6" y="22" width="12" height="12" rx="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.5"/>
              <rect x="22" y="22" width="12" height="12" rx="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              <path d="M18 12h4M12 18v4M28 18v4M18 28h4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.6"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="feature-card__title">Multi-Authority</h3>
          <p class="feature-card__body">
            Attribute keys can be issued by independent authorities without
            coordination. A single ciphertext policy can span attributes from
            multiple distrusting organisations.
          </p>
          <div class="feature-card__tag">Decentralised issuance</div>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-card__icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M8 32 C8 20 20 8 32 8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              <path d="M8 32 C8 26 14 20 20 20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.5"/>
              <circle cx="32" cy="8" r="3" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.7"/>
              <circle cx="8" cy="32" r="3" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.7"/>
              <circle cx="20" cy="20" r="2.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="feature-card__title">Compact Ciphertext</h3>
          <p class="feature-card__body">
            CABE's wire format achieves a constant-size ciphertext component
            regardless of policy complexity, using CBOR encoding and curve
            point compression throughout.
          </p>
          <div class="feature-card__tag">CBOR-encoded wire format</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
  <section class="mechanism" id="how-it-works">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-label">003 · Mechanism</span>
        <h2 class="section-heading">Four algorithms,<br />one coherent system.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="mechanism__flow">
        <div class="mech-step">
          <div class="mech-step__number">01</div>
          <div class="mech-step__content">
            <h3 class="mech-step__title">Setup</h3>
            <p class="mech-step__body">
              A trusted authority (or distributed set of authorities) runs
              <code>CABE.Setup(λ, U)</code> to generate a master public key
              <code>MPK</code> and master secret key <code>MSK</code> over
              attribute universe <em>U</em>.
            </p>
            <div class="mech-step__algo">
              <span class="algo-label">Output:</span>
              <span class="algo-value">(MPK, MSK)</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mech-connector" aria-hidden="true"></div>

        <div class="mech-step">
          <div class="mech-step__number">02</div>
          <div class="mech-step__content">
            <h3 class="mech-step__title">Key Generation</h3>
            <p class="mech-step__body">
              For a user with attribute set <em>S</em>, the authority issues
              a decryption key <code>SK_S</code> via <code>CABE.KeyGen(MSK, S)</code>.
              Each key is independently blinded to prevent collusion.
            </p>
            <div class="mech-step__algo">
              <span class="algo-label">Output:</span>
              <span class="algo-value">SK_S</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mech-connector" aria-hidden="true"></div>

        <div class="mech-step">
          <div class="mech-step__number">03</div>
          <div class="mech-step__content">
            <h3 class="mech-step__title">Encrypt</h3>
            <p class="mech-step__body">
              An encryptor specifies an access policy <em>P</em> (boolean circuit
              over attributes) and calls <code>CABE.Encrypt(MPK, m, P)</code>.
              The policy is embedded in the CBOR ciphertext header.
            </p>
            <div class="mech-step__algo">
              <span class="algo-label">Output:</span>
              <span class="algo-value">CT = (header‖body)</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mech-connector" aria-hidden="true"></div>

        <div class="mech-step">
          <div class="mech-step__number">04</div>
          <div class="mech-step__content">
            <h3 class="mech-step__title">Decrypt</h3>
            <p class="mech-step__body">
              A recipient with key <code>SK_S</code> calls
              <code>CABE.Decrypt(SK_S, CT)</code>. Decryption succeeds
              iff <em>S</em> satisfies <em>P</em>; otherwise the function
              returns ⊥ without leaking partial information.
            </p>
            <div class="mech-step__algo">
              <span class="algo-label">Output:</span>
              <span class="algo-value">m or ⊥</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mechanism__policy-example">
        <div class="policy-example__header">
          <span class="policy-example__label">Example Policy Expression</span>
          <span class="policy-example__badge">CP-CABE</span>
        </div>
        <div class="policy-example__code">
          <pre><code><span class="tok-comment">// Grant access to senior engineering staff or auditors in the EU</span>
<span class="tok-keyword">POLICY</span> <span class="tok-string">"data/financial/q4-2024"</span> := (
  (<span class="tok-attr">role</span>:<span class="tok-value">engineer</span> AND <span class="tok-attr">clearance</span>:<span class="tok-value">senior</span>)
  OR
  (<span class="tok-attr">role</span>:<span class="tok-value">auditor</span> AND <span class="tok-attr">region</span>:<span class="tok-value">EU</span>)
)

<span class="tok-comment">// Encoded in CBOR header as a monotone boolean circuit</span>
<span class="tok-keyword">CABE.Encrypt</span>(MPK, plaintext, policy) <span class="tok-op">→</span> <span class="tok-type">CipherText</span></code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SPEC / CTA -->
  <section class="spec" id="spec">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-label">004 · Specification</span>
        <h2 class="section-heading">Standards-track<br />documentation.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="spec__grid">
        <div class="spec-doc">
          <div class="spec-doc__type">Internet-Draft</div>
          <h3 class="spec-doc__title">draft-cabe-core-00</h3>
          <p class="spec-doc__desc">Core wire format, algorithm identifiers, and CBOR encoding for CABE ciphertexts, keys, and policies.</p>
          <div class="spec-doc__meta">
            <span>Status: Active Draft</span>
            <span>March 2025</span>
          </div>
          <a href="#cta" class="spec-doc__link">View Draft →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="spec-doc">
          <div class="spec-doc__type">Internet-Draft</div>
          <h3 class="spec-doc__title">draft-cabe-algorithms-00</h3>
          <p class="spec-doc__desc">Mandatory-to-implement algorithms: BLS12-381 pairing group, FAME-CP construction, and HKDF-based key derivation.</p>
          <div class="spec-doc__meta">
            <span>Status: Active Draft</span>
            <span>March 2025</span>
          </div>
          <a href="#cta" class="spec-doc__link">View Draft →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="spec-doc">
          <div class="spec-doc__type">Internet-Draft</div>
          <h3 class="spec-doc__title">draft-cabe-policy-lang-00</h3>
          <p class="spec-doc__desc">CABE Policy Expression Language (CPEL): syntax, semantics, and canonical CBOR serialisation of access policies.</p>
          <div class="spec-doc__meta">
            <span>Status: Active Draft</span>
            <span>March 2025</span>
          </div>
          <a href="#cta" class="spec-doc__link">View Draft →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="spec-doc spec-doc--wip">
          <div class="spec-doc__type">Internet-Draft</div>
          <h3 class="spec-doc__title">draft-cabe-multi-authority-00</h3>
          <p class="spec-doc__desc">Extensions for multi-authority deployments: authority registration, attribute namespacing, and inter-authority trust.</p>
          <div class="spec-doc__meta">
            <span>Status: In Progress</span>
            <span>Q2 2025</span>
          </div>
          <a href="#cta" class="spec-doc__link">Coming Soon</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA / MAILING LIST -->
  <section class="mc-section" id="cta">
    <div class="mc-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="container mc-inner">
      <div class="mc-text">
        <span class="section-label mc-label">Find out more</span>
        <h2 class="mc-heading">Join the CABE ecosystem.</h2>
        <p class="mc-body">
          Sign up and receive more information on:
        </p>
        <ul class="mc-body">
        <li>Adopting CABE in your organization</li>
        <li>Incorporating CABE technology into your products</li>
        <li>Getting involved in the specification process</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="mc-form-wrap">
        <!-- Mailchimp embedded form — replace action URL with your list's POST URL -->
        <form
          action="https://messier42.us19.list-manage.com/subscribe/post?u=f91016b8b104eeb6c1e840cc8&amp;id=edafba7923&amp;f_id=0094c2e1f0"
          method="post"
          target="_blank"
          novalidate
          class="mc-form"
        >
          <!-- Real field -->
          <div class="mc-field">
            <label for="mc-email" class="mc-field__label">Email address</label>
            <div class="mc-field__row">
              <input
                type="email"
                name="EMAIL"
                id="mc-email"
                placeholder="you@example.com"
                required
                class="mc-field__input"
              />
              <button type="submit" name="subscribe" class="mc-field__btn btn btn--primary">
                Subscribe
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <!-- Mailchimp bot-trap — do not remove -->
          <div style="position:absolute;left:-5000px" aria-hidden="true">
            <input type="text" name="b_f91016b8b104eeb6c1e840cc8_edafba7923" tabindex="-1" value="" />
          </div>
          <input type="hidden" name="tags" value="410" />
